# Cognito Webapp - Coding Standards

## Technology Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| Next.js 16 | React framework (App Router) |
| React 19 | UI library |
| Tailwind CSS | Styling |
| shadcn/ui | UI components |
| Lucide | Icons |

## Project Structure

```text
apps/webapp/
├── src/
│   ├── app/                    # Next.js App Router pages
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── ui/                 # shadcn/ui primitives (DO NOT MODIFY)
│   │   ├── shared/             # Reusable components
│   │   └── [feature]/          # Feature-specific components
│   └── lib/                    # Utilities
├── public/                     # Static assets
└── docs/                       # Implementation docs
```

## Key Conventions

### Component Structure

- **Never modify primitives** in `src/components/ui/` directly
- Add props for customization and pass from consuming components
- Use React 19 patterns (`ref` as prop instead of `forwardRef`)

### Web MCP

- Place all MCP tool implementations in `src/mcp/tools/`
- Register new tools in `src/mcp/registry.ts`

### Styling

- All clickable buttons must include `cursor-pointer`
- Use `mcp-scrollable` class for scrollable containers
- Avoid broad CSS selectors that can affect unrelated components

### Commands

```bash
pnpm dev:webapp                 # Start dev server
pnpm --filter @cognito/webapp dev
pnpm --filter @cognito/webapp build
```

### Git Commits

```bash
feat(webapp): add new feature
fix(webapp): resolve issue
```

## Shared Package

```typescript
import type { WriteTone } from '@cognito/shared';
import { TONE_INSTRUCTIONS } from '@cognito/shared';
```
